create that full folder + file structure in one go using PowerShell with a small script.

Run this in PowerShell:

$base = "D:\VoiceBot-Docker"

# Create folders
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path "$base\app" -Force
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path "$base\voices" -Force
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path "$base\client" -Force

# Create files
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "$base\app\main.py" -Force
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "$base\app\requirements.txt" -Force
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "$base\client\relay.py" -Force
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "$base\Dockerfile" -Force
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "$base\docker-compose.yml" -Force
Quick verification
tree D:\VoiceBot-Docker
